.TH HISTORY-INTELLIGENCE 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
history-intelligence \- [\-\-scan N] [\-\-slow\-ms MS] [\-\-phi] [\-\-quiet]
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBhistory-intelligence --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
usage: history-intelligence [-h] [--json] [--window DAYS] [--limit N]
                            [--scan N] [--slow-ms MS] [--phi] [--quiet]
                            [--gate] [--no-atuin] [--no-color] [--db PATH]

Synthesize zdots runtime history (command_runs + shell_hook_metrics + atuin)
into an interface report.

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --json         emit machine-readable JSON
  --window DAYS  analysis window in days (default: 7)
  --limit N      rows per section (default: 12)
  --scan N       atuin entries to scan for frequency (default: 1000)
  --slow-ms MS   hook elapsed floor counted as a performance concern (default:
                 50)
  --phi          PHI accountability + signals only
  --quiet        signals only (suppress detail sections)
  --gate         exit non-zero if any high-severity signal is present (for
                 hooks/CI)
  --no-atuin     skip atuin frequency
  --no-color     disable ANSI color
  --db PATH      history.sqlite3 path (default: XDG state)
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
